@startuml
!theme plain
title Open WebUI v0.13.0 架构调研视图\n源码结构与仓库 Compose 示例

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"

actor "用户" as User

node "浏览器" as Browser {
  component "Svelte / SvelteKit 前端\n在浏览器运行" as Frontend
}

node "Docker Compose 示例部署" as Deployment {
  node "open-webui 容器\n主机 3000 → 容器 8080" as WebContainer {
    component "FastAPI / Uvicorn\n同一主应用托管 API 与静态前端" as API
    component "WebSocket / Socket.IO" as WS
    component "业务路由模块\n聊天、用户、文件、知识库、检索、模型" as Routes
    component "RAG 处理\n解析、切分、Embedding、检索、可选重排" as RAG
    component "模型接入路由\nOllama / OpenAI 兼容 API" as Provider
    folder "open-webui 持久化卷\n/app/backend/data\nSQLite + Chroma + 本地文件（默认）" as AppVolume
  }

  node "ollama 容器\nCompose 示例" as OllamaContainer {
    component "Ollama 模型服务" as Ollama
  }

  folder "ollama 持久化卷\n模型文件" as ModelVolume
}

cloud "可选远程模型服务\nOpenAI 兼容 API 等" as RemoteModels
cloud "可选外部持久化适配器\nPostgreSQL / pgvector\nS3 / GCS / Azure 等" as ExternalStores

User --> Frontend : HTTPS / HTTP
Frontend --> API : REST API
Frontend --> WS : 实时消息
API --> Routes
Routes --> RAG
Routes --> Provider

API --> AppVolume : 结构化数据
RAG --> AppVolume : 向量索引
Routes --> AppVolume : 文件读写

Provider --> Ollama : HTTP API\n默认 Compose 连接
Provider ..> RemoteModels : 按配置调用
Ollama --> ModelVolume : 模型持久化
API ..> ExternalStores : 按配置替换
RAG ..> ExternalStores : 按配置替换
Routes ..> ExternalStores : 按配置替换

note bottom of Deployment
  仓库 Compose 示例是一个 WebUI 容器加一个 Ollama 容器。
  SQLite、Chroma 和本地文件使用 WebUI 数据卷持久化；
  PostgreSQL/pgvector 与对象存储是可配置替代项，
  并非默认 Compose 中各自独立运行的服务。
  该示例未展示多副本、负载均衡或灾备。
end note

legend right
  | 线型 | 含义 |
  | --> | 主要请求 / 数据路径 |
  | ..> | 可选或配置后才使用 |
  本图为对 v0.13.0 源码与 Compose 示例的归纳，
  不是 Open WebUI 官方发布的部署架构图。
endlegend
@enduml
